  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n[Eaug]\n[C/E]\n[D]\n[F]\n[Fm]I've got a\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]little black book with my\npoems in I've got a\n[E]bag with a toothbrush and a\ncomb in [E7]When\n[F]I'm a good dog they\nsometimes throw me a\n[C]bone in\n[F]I got e-\n[C]lastic bands keeping my shoes\non Got those\n[E]swollen hand\nblues. [E7]I got\n[F]thirteen channels of\nshit on the T.V. to\n[C]choose from\nI've got e-\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C]lectric light\n[C7]And I've got second\nsight I've got a-\n[F]mazing\n[Fm]powers of obser-\n[C]vation [Em7/B]\n[Am]  [D/F#]\n[G]And that is how I know\n[E/G#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]When I try to get through\n[C/G]On the telephone to\nyou\n[D/F#]\n[Fm]There'll be nobody\n\n[Intrelude]\n[C]home\n[F]\n[C]\n[F]I've got the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]obligatory Hendrix\nperm And the in-\n[E]evitable pinhole\nburns [E7]\n[F]All down the front of my\nfavourite satin\n[C]shirt\n[F]I've got\n[C]nicotine stains on my\nfingers I've got a\n[E]silver spoon on a chain\n[E7]I've got a\n[F]grand piano to\nprop up my mortal re-\n[C]mains\nI've got\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C]wild staring eyes\n[C7]I've got a strong urge to\nfly\n[F]But\n[Fm]I've got nowhere to\n[C]fly to [Em7/B]\n[Am]  [D/F#]\n[G]\n[E/G#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]Ooh,\nbabe,\n[C/G]when I pick up the\nphone\n[D/F#]\n[Fm]There's still nobody\n\n[Intrelude]\n[C]home\n[F]\n[C]\n[F]I've got a\n\n[Outro]\n[C]pair of Gohills boots\nBut I've got\n[E]fad ing\n[E7]roots.",
